WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.568
Watch and read: How should you turn pages?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.763
The answer is: gently. Books help us learn when we care for them.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:11.390
Watch and read: How should you keep a library book?

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:16.307
The answer is: on a shelf. Books help us learn when we care for them.
